{"availability":"available","full":"flyfish-dev/cad-viewer","name":"cad-viewer","description":"Production-oriented browser CAD viewer for DWG, DXF, DWF, DWFx and XPS with LibreDWG WASM, WebGL/Canvas rendering, external SHX references and native DWF support.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":16,"forks":4,"created":"2026-06-11T09:59:55Z","updated":"2026-09-08T14:51:34Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cad-viewer-iys.pages.dev","topics":["cad","cad-viewer","cloudflare-pages","dwf","dwg","dxf","typescript","wasm","webgl"],"demo":"https://cad-viewer-iys.pages.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:35:28.685Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:35:28.685Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:35:28.685Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.487Z","stars":16,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-09T15:35:28.685Z","stars":16,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A professional, lightweight, extensible frontend CAD viewer for modern browsers.","Live demo: cad-viewer-iys.pages.dev Source: github.com/flyfish-dev/cad-viewer","The project provides a clean loader architecture for DWG, DXF, DWF, DWFx and XPS. DWG/DXF are normalized into a common CadDocument and rendered through retained WebGL with a lightweight Canvas overlay; DWF/DWFx/XPS are delegated to the native dwf-viewer renderer for WebGL-accelerated W2D and XPS/DWFx vectors, W3D/HSF eModel geometry, embedded XPS fonts and optional WASM fallback. Files are read locally in the browser; the viewer does not upload drawings to a backend."],"features":["Pure frontend viewer component: new CadViewer({ container }) or new CadViewer({ canvas }).","Loader registry: DWG, DXF and DWF loaders are independent and replaceable; native-renderable loaders can mount their own optimized viewer.","DWG preview: browser-local parsing through LibreDWG WebAssembly, executed in a Web Worker by default.","DWG view and linetype fidelity: active planar saved views, block-contained text alignment and widths, closed/wide polylines, LTYPE tables, BYLAYER/BYBLOCK inheritance, dash/dot patterns and stable pattern scaling.","External SHX references: detects missing complex-linetype shape fonts, accepts local files or API-provided bytes, validates required glyphs and renders SHX shape/text geometry in Canvas2D and WebGL."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flyfish-dev/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"07c2e629ea15887146814722aa9c5e260cc6426e114b631db27674a3cdbb4481","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.819Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.819Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A professional, lightweight, extensible frontend CAD viewer for modern browsers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flyfish-dev/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"07c2e629ea15887146814722aa9c5e260cc6426e114b631db27674a3cdbb4481","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flyfish-dev/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.820Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-08T14:51:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flyfish-dev/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:19.822Z","hash":"07c2e629ea15887146814722aa9c5e260cc6426e114b631db27674a3cdbb4481","originalBytes":27946,"storedBytes":27946,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["dwg","wasm","npm","dwf","text","demo","worker","run","xps","added","webgl","dwfx","new","now","dxf","cadviewer","native","pages","renderer","auto","await","changed","dwf-viewer","package","true","url","what","cad","default","files","geometry","viewer","when","adaptive","bash","build","canvas2d","const","file","libredwg","canvas","color","colors","format","loader","shx","bom","caddocument","dwg-worker.js","fallback","optional","preview","rendering","through","active","cad-viewer","drawing","dwfv-render.wasm","fallback.","path","uses","viewport","before","container","document